{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14107130","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1410713001:1":{"text":"魔物掉的东西上，竟然有我们矮人的符文！","source_cn":"魔物掉的东西上，竟然有我们矮人的符文！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xE4A84366D3AB9635","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410713002:1":{"text":"这太奇怪了……算了，也不能抓它问上一问，只能我们先留着了。","source_cn":"这太奇怪了……算了，也不能抓它问上一问，只能我们先留着了。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xA5C5A2B1B9938F12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410713003:1":{"text":"不过，这片区域机关重重——","source_cn":"不过，这片区域机关重重——","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xAFAA99E6FD6E2824","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410713004:1":{"text":"以我对矮人工艺的了解，这很可能是开启机关的钥匙。<st...","source_cn":"以我对矮人工艺的了解，这很可能是开启机关的钥匙。<st...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1410713004":{"text":"以我对矮人工艺的了解，这很可能是开启机关的钥匙。<style=stress><player_name></style>，你先拿好。","source_cn":"以我对矮人工艺的了解，这很可能是开启机关的钥匙。<style=stress><player_name></style>，你先拿好。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x44C415E0C5A5C785","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410713005:1":{"text":"至于我，我得先想办法拿走杜恩加尔……决不能让它再遭受亵渎！","source_cn":"至于我，我得先想办法拿走杜恩加尔……决不能让它再遭受亵渎！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xCB023B6047BCD8E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410713006:1":{"text":"等等，你们仔细听，有没有听到什么声音？","source_cn":"等等，你们仔细听，有没有听到什么声音？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA6A73A0A797B14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410713007:1":{"text":"你是指水流的声音吗？","source_cn":"你是指水流的声音吗？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x47FFEE87D0E0966F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410713008:1":{"text":"不……是有个声音在呼唤我。","source_cn":"不……是有个声音在呼唤我。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x35D68FD7C8E0E1D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410713009:1":{"text":"声音传来的方向，正是那把弓的所在之处。","source_cn":"声音传来的方向，正是那把弓的所在之处。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xEACDBC5D026087DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:14